Package: REDCapCDMSTAT
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Data Management and Statistical Analysis for 'REDCap' and 'REDCap Cloud'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Neudata Consultancy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "b.osangir@gmail.com")
Description: A single engine that closes the loop between clinical data
    management and biostatistics on 'REDCap' projects. It keeps a local cache
    that is patched incrementally from the 'REDCap' log and Data Entry Trigger
    calls, detects data dictionary drift, compiles branching logic and
    calculated fields from the live dictionary, runs validation rules, keeps an
    audited query ledger, freezes hashed analysis data cuts, reshapes
    longitudinal and repeating data, generates metadata-driven baseline tables
    with guarded test selection, and records every analytic action as a
    reproducible R script. A 'shiny' app, a 'plumber' API and a 'Quarto'
    report template are shipped on top of the same engine.
